bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    interpreter_class_identity_no_scope_fallback_fail_open_2026_11_27, 0, "Follow-up of interpreter_same_name_class_method_dispatch_collision_2026_11_26 (Fable review 2026-11-27). module_cache.rs class_identity_matches: when the executing module scope has no answer for the type name (scoped_walk returns None), an owner-exact instance is accepted by its source name alone. That fallback is fail-open: a module that never imported the other owner class still matches it by bare name. It should fail closed or resolve through the flat class table."

